  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed extension, by reason of its scale, bulk and siting and when combined with the multiple existing extensions already on site, would result in a harmful sense of enclosure and loss of outlook to both neighbouring properties, in particular the occupiers of no.15 Norfolk Road. The proposal is therefore contrary to adopted Local Plan Policies CC2 and SC7 and the intent of the Residential Extensions Guidelines.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed extension would, as a result of its significant scale and bulk, dominate the rear elevation of the property, appear incongruous and read as an overdevelopment when combined with existing extensions already in place, contrary to Local Plan policies CC1, SC7 and the intent of the Residential Extensions Guidelines."
  ],
